{"entity_id":"npc.crono","entity_type":"npc","canonical_name":"Crono / 克罗诺","language":"zh","aliases":["Crono","克罗诺","克罗洛"],"description_short":"克罗诺是主角，早期偏稳定物理输出和战斗核心。","description_long":"低剧透上，把他当队伍轴心即可。随着队友加入，他会和不同角色形成双人技。","progress_gate":"start","spoiler_level":"none","source_refs":["ct.community_wiki","ct.localized_name_audit","ct.project_notes"],"confidence":"community","answer_templates":[{"template_id":"template.ct.crono.zh","language":"zh","intent":"name_mapping","question_patterns":["克罗诺是谁","克罗洛是谁","主角是谁"],"answer":"克罗诺是主角，早期偏稳定物理输出。随着队友加入，他会和不同角色形成双人技。","source_refs":["ct.project_notes"],"spoiler_level":"none"}]}
{"entity_id":"npc.marle","entity_type":"npc","canonical_name":"Marle / 玛尔","language":"zh","aliases":["Marle","玛尔","玛儿","马尔"],"description_short":"玛尔是早期重要队友，和开局事件、回复/辅助方向有关。","description_long":"她的剧情身份不宜过早展开。战斗上先把她看作能提供回复和辅助价值的队友。","progress_gate":"start","spoiler_level":"light","source_refs":["ct.community_wiki","ct.localized_name_audit","ct.project_notes"],"confidence":"community","answer_templates":[{"template_id":"template.ct.marle.zh","language":"zh","intent":"name_mapping","question_patterns":["玛尔是谁","马尔是谁","玛尔怎么用"],"answer":"玛尔是早期重要队友，战斗上有回复和辅助价值。她的剧情身份容易剧透，前期先按队友定位理解。","source_refs":["ct.project_notes"],"spoiler_level":"light"}]}
{"entity_id":"npc.lucca","entity_type":"npc","canonical_name":"Lucca / 露卡","language":"zh","aliases":["Lucca","露卡","露佳"],"description_short":"露卡是克罗诺的朋友和发明家型队友，早期偏火力和机关/科技氛围。","description_long":"战斗上她能提供明确的攻击 Tech，也常和主线装置、实验和技术事件相关。","progress_gate":"start","spoiler_level":"none","source_refs":["ct.community_wiki","ct.localized_name_audit","ct.project_notes"],"confidence":"community","answer_templates":[{"template_id":"template.ct.lucca.zh","language":"zh","intent":"name_mapping","question_patterns":["露卡是谁","露佳是谁","露卡怎么用"],"answer":"露卡是克罗诺的朋友和发明家型队友，早期偏攻击 Tech 和科技事件相关。","source_refs":["ct.project_notes"],"spoiler_level":"none"}]}
{"entity_id":"npc.frog","entity_type":"npc","canonical_name":"Frog / 青蛙","language":"zh","aliases":["Frog","青蛙","蛙"],"description_short":"青蛙是角色名，不是普通动物词；他与中世相关，早期问到应保持低剧透。","description_long":"只有在 Chrono Trigger 语境或角色问题里，`青蛙` 才应映射到 Frog。具体身份和过去属于剧透程度更高的内容。","progress_gate":"early_game","spoiler_level":"light","source_refs":["ct.community_wiki","ct.localized_name_audit","ct.project_notes"],"confidence":"community","answer_templates":[{"template_id":"template.ct.frog.zh","language":"zh","intent":"name_mapping","question_patterns":["青蛙是谁","Frog 是谁"],"answer":"这里的青蛙是角色名，和中世相关。低剧透下先把他当重要队友理解，具体过去等剧情推进再问。","source_refs":["ct.project_notes"],"spoiler_level":"light"}]}
{"entity_id":"npc.robo","entity_type":"npc","canonical_name":"Robo / 罗伯","language":"zh","aliases":["Robo","罗伯","罗伯机器人"],"description_short":"罗伯是未来相关队友，机器/机器人语境下要和普通敌人区分。","description_long":"早期只需要知道他是未来时代相关队友。`机器人` 单独出现太宽泛，alias 应使用更具体短语。","progress_gate":"early_game","spoiler_level":"light","source_refs":["ct.community_wiki","ct.localized_name_audit","ct.project_notes"],"confidence":"community","answer_templates":[{"template_id":"template.ct.robo.zh","language":"zh","intent":"name_mapping","question_patterns":["罗伯是谁","罗伯机器人是谁"],"answer":"罗伯是未来相关队友，和机器/机器人语境有关。单说“机器人”可能也指敌人，最好用罗伯来问。","source_refs":["ct.project_notes"],"spoiler_level":"light"}]}
{"entity_id":"npc.ayla","entity_type":"npc","canonical_name":"Ayla / 艾拉","language":"zh","aliases":["Ayla","艾拉","艾啦"],"description_short":"艾拉是中期后相关队友，Lite 包只做名称识别和低剧透定位。","description_long":"她与原始时代相关。早期玩家问到时，先说明这是后续队友，不直接展开加入路线或剧情。","progress_gate":"mid_game","spoiler_level":"medium","source_refs":["ct.community_wiki","ct.localized_name_audit","ct.project_notes"],"confidence":"community","answer_templates":[{"template_id":"template.ct.ayla.zh","language":"zh","intent":"name_mapping","question_patterns":["艾拉是谁","艾啦是谁"],"answer_light":"艾拉是中期后相关队友，和原始时代有关。早期只做名称识别，加入路线和剧情等到对应进度再问。","source_refs":["ct.project_notes"],"spoiler_level":"medium"}]}
{"entity_id":"npc.magus","entity_type":"npc","canonical_name":"Magus / 魔王","language":"zh","aliases":["Magus","魔王","玛格斯"],"description_short":"魔王是特定角色名，也是 Boss 语境词；Lite 包默认按角色识别并做剧透提醒。","description_long":"`魔王` 不能当普通“恶魔王”泛词使用。问角色身份时映射到 Magus；问战斗时用 boss.magus；后续立场和路线会剧透。","progress_gate":"mid_game","spoiler_level":"medium","source_refs":["ct.community_wiki","ct.localized_name_audit","ct.project_notes"],"confidence":"community","answer_templates":[{"template_id":"template.ct.magus.zh","language":"zh","intent":"name_mapping","question_patterns":["魔王是谁","Magus 是谁","魔王现在能问吗"],"answer_light":"魔王在本作里是特定角色名。继续讲身份、战斗和后续立场会剧透；如果你还在早期，先知道这是中期后重要人物即可。","source_refs":["ct.project_notes"],"spoiler_level":"medium"}]}
